rows: cumsum along the last axis of a [3, n] input: rewritten has the expected scan: true
rows: cumsum along the last axis of a [3, n] input: rewritten writes no n x n node: true
rows: cumsum along the last axis of a [3, n] input: rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
rows: cumsum along the last axis of a [3, n] input: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
strict: an exclusive prefix sum (i < o): composed has no scan: true
strict: an exclusive prefix sum (i < o): rewritten has the expected scan: true
strict: an exclusive prefix sum (i < o): rewritten writes no n x n node: true
strict: an exclusive prefix sum (i < o): rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
strict: an exclusive prefix sum (i < o): rewritten equals the host oracle: true
reversed: a suffix sum (i >= o): composed has no scan: true
reversed: a suffix sum (i >= o): rewritten has the expected scan: true
reversed: a suffix sum (i >= o): rewritten writes no n x n node: true
reversed: a suffix sum (i >= o): rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
reversed: a suffix sum (i >= o): rewritten equals the host oracle: true
where: the selected sum: composed has no scan: true
where: the selected sum: rewritten has the expected scan: true
where: the selected sum: rewritten writes no n x n node: true
where: the selected sum: rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
where: the selected sum: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
cummax: where and @^^ over negative values with repeated maxima: composed has no scan: true
cummax: where and @^^ over negative values with repeated maxima: rewritten has the expected scan: true
cummax: where and @^^ over negative values with repeated maxima: rewritten writes no n x n node: true
cummax: where and @^^ over negative values with repeated maxima: rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
cummax: where and @^^ over negative values with repeated maxima: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
cummax, strict: the first prefix is empty: composed has no scan: true
cummax, strict: the first prefix is empty: rewritten has the expected scan: true
cummax, strict: the first prefix is empty: rewritten writes no n x n node: true
cummax, strict: the first prefix is empty: rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
cummax, strict: the first prefix is empty: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
tropical: @^+ against a 0 / -inf log-mask: composed has no scan: true
tropical: @^+ against a 0 / -inf log-mask: rewritten has the expected scan: true
tropical: @^+ against a 0 / -inf log-mask: rewritten writes no n x n node: true
tropical: @^+ against a 0 / -inf log-mask: rewritten equals the composed result bitwise: true
tropical: @^+ against a 0 / -inf log-mask: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
--- leg 3: hand-built raw lowerings, executed ---
the hand-built payloads' partial sums are exact in f32: true
ps_min: the rewrite emits one scan: true
ps_min: no step is guarded: true
ps_min: the scan survives optimization: true
ps_min: rewritten equals the composed execution bitwise: true
ps_min: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
ps_min: the rewrite is idempotent: true
ps_min_order: the rewrite emits one scan: true
ps_min_order: no step is guarded: true
ps_min_order: the scan survives optimization: true
ps_min_order: rewritten equals the composed execution bitwise: true
ps_min_order: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
ps_min_order: the rewrite is idempotent: true
ps_complement: the rewrite emits one scan: true
ps_complement: no step is guarded: true
ps_complement: the scan survives optimization: true
ps_complement: rewritten equals the composed execution bitwise: true
ps_complement: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
ps_complement: the rewrite is idempotent: true
ps_suffix: the rewrite emits one scan: true
ps_suffix: no step is guarded: true
ps_suffix: the scan survives optimization: true
ps_suffix: rewritten equals the composed execution bitwise: true
ps_suffix: rewritten equals the host oracle: true
ps_suffix: the rewrite is idempotent: true
